                <mxCell id="panelE_legend" value="How to read: &#39;SCOPE tools&#39; shows what the refiner mini-loop invoked — always `(single_pass refiner)` on current master (WI_STAGE1_ENABLED=1 path — 1 Anthropic call, no tools inside). &#39;EXECUTE tools&#39; is the ordered tool_use sequence Cypher&#39;s model emitted after SCOPE handed off the brief. &#39;passed to&#39; = PM (captured_to_board) | EXECUTE (phase=2) | SCOPE-only (didn&#39;t advance)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#455a64;spacingLeft=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
