                <mxCell id="cur_capture" value="1 · CAPTURE — captureToBoard()  · Insert tasks row: {id: task_…, goal_text, pm_intent, source_session_id} · intent enum: brainstorm | plan | decide (from mapping above) · Session closes with outcome=&#39;captured_to_board&#39; · NO execution — this is a thinking-card, not a doing-card" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#2e7d32;fontColor=#1b5e20;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
